From: Linda + Claude <linda.lei@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:48:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Polish UI for demo: Rescue theme, best-guess card,
 clearer waiting/retry
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add a high-contrast "Rescue" color theme (night navy, signal orange,
  search blue) and make it the default; old themes stay in Settings
- Results: big "Best guess" card with score bar, Open in Google Maps and
  Copy summary; shown first on phones
- New investigation: progress panel with timer and steps while analyzing;
  clear "That didn't work" card with a one-tap Try again (photo stays selected)
- Fill "When was it taken?" from the photo's camera date (exifr)
- Be honest that notes are saved with the report but not used by the finder
- Library cards show "Best guess: place · score"; hide the desk prefix in titles
- Fix date-only values showing one day early in western time zones

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LKM61qkzDm4pZ2xsTBFDcU
